cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use NEEC, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "NEEC: Normative Economic Evaluation Criteria"
abstract: >-
  NEEC compares economic systems on one fixed set of normative criteria.
  Version 2 scores each system on 26 criteria in five domains (Material
  Security, Human Autonomy, System Resilience, Ethical Integrity and
  Implementation Viability), with a published scoring protocol, registers
  of contestable calls, blind replication and a verification harness that
  reproduces every result byte for byte.
type: dataset
authors:
